# Driver smoke test for @real: one question, one answer.
@real
@size 140x45
@setup printf 'package main\n\nfunc main() {}\n' > main.go && git add -A && git -c user.name=qa -c user.email=qa@example.invalid commit -qm main
WAITFOR /describe a task/ 30
SHOT ready
TURN What files are in this project? Answer in one line.
SHOT answered
EXPECT /main\.go/
